xt":"Because she has been drugged and trained for a long time, she has earned his trust, and sometimes she even applies correctional programs to her targets on his behalf."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c105781"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"私立・麗宋学園のカウンセラーを務める女性。見た目はさっぱりとした気さくなお姉さんと言った感じで生徒たちに人気があり、人望も厚い。しかし本人はすでに義人に調教されており、忠実な助手になっている。薬漬けで調教されている期間が長いため、彼の信頼も厚く、ときには彼の代わりにターゲットに矯正プログラムを施すこともある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23809","sourceWorkId":"31906","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"私立・麗宋学園のカウンセラーを務める女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目はさっぱりとした気さくなお姉さんと言った感じで生徒たちに人気があり、人望も厚い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし本人はすでに義人に調教されており、忠実な助手になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"薬漬けで調教されている期間が長いため、彼の信頼も厚く、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ときには彼の代わりにターゲットに矯正プログラムを施すこともある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"105935"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5e839683a2a092c39743e592fc5cd5577226f0b32613a7e8c1f8096f52f56034.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe595e3bbdcd03f7a61f8d50e2cf405bc1ba55ed0a9f4dcff1a1a4b57d3eb46b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"夏乃 うめ","creatorId":"vndb:s26233","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s26233","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s26233","name":"夏乃うめ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:90308","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c105779","characterName":"稲原 義人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c105779"},"originalCharacterName":"稲原 義人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"173"},"sex